              "text": "پہاڑی (pahāṛī) is pahāṛ, \"a mountain\", with the ending -ī that makes a smaller one. pahāṛ comes from a reconstructed pāhāḍa, \"rock, hill\", which CDIAL connects, probably, with Sanskrit pāṣāṇa, \"stone\" (CDIAL 8141)."
